  "title": "Bit Digital Announces Proposed Offering of $100 Million Convertible Notes",
  "summary": "Bit Digital, Inc. (Nasdaq: BTBT), today announced a proposed registered underwritten public offering (the “Offering”) by the Company of $100,000,000 aggregate principal amount of its convertible senior notes due 2030 (the “Notes”), subject to market and other conditions. The Company also intends to grant the underwriters in the Offering a 30-day option to purchase up to an additional $15,000,000 aggregate principal amount of Notes on the same terms and conditions, solely to cover over-allotments.",
